direction: right

A: 迟到数据 INSERT {class: base}
B: CH 表 {class: base}
C: TTL 扫描 {shape: diamond; class: base}
Keep: 保留, 不删 {class: warn}
Drop: 自动 DROP PARTITION {class: ok}
D: "下次 export 扫到\n过期未导出" {class: base}
E: 追加导出到 S3 {class: base}
F: 回填 exported_at {class: base}

A -> B: exported_at = NULL
B -> C
C -> Keep: exported_at IS NULL
C -> Drop: "exported_at IS NOT NULL\n且超 4 个月"
Keep -> D
D -> E
E -> F
F -> C
